# Chinese Lecture Interpreter — API key configuration
#
# 1. Copy this file to ".env" (same folder as ChineseLectureInterpreter.exe,
#    or the repo root when running from source).
# 2. Get a free API key at https://console.groq.com/keys
# 3. Paste the key after the "=" below and save.
#
# The .env file is never bundled with the app and must not be shared.

GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
